1 NOTE {geni:about_me} She had auburn brown hair that my grandmother braided after she died for her funeral. When I was a little girl, my grandmother told me that story as she braided my hair, which was the same red-brown color as her mo
2 CONC ther's.
2 CONT
2 CONT Karoline was cared for when she was dying of tuberculosis by Anna Johannesdatter Vedå Fossmark, her younger sister.  Anna was married to Mons Olson Fossmark, which is how these two women happened to be on this particular farm.  My
2 CONC  great-grandparents moved there when Gudmund got a job working on the Olso-Bergen railway path that was being built.  They had been living at Elvik prior to this time, but moved when the oldest son returned from America and reclai
2 CONC med that farm, displacing my great-grandparents.  
2 CONT --------------------
