0 @I6000000001697303727@ INDI
1 NAME Nils Tomassen /Stavenes/
2 GIVN Nils Tomassen
2 SURN Stavenes
2 _MARNM Stavenes
1 NAME Nils/ Thomassen/ Tomassen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 25 JAN 1809
2 PLAC Stavenes br 1
