1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He appeared on the 1801 Census at Jarland, Samnanger, Hordaland, with his father, brother and step-mother, as: Torbjørn Engelsen, his child (Hans børn), 15, unmarried (Ugivt).
2 CONT
2 CONT Took over the lease (bygsel) on Jarland, Samnanger, Hordaland (Gnr. 36 br. B) after his brother's death in 1815 and held it until his death in 1848.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kilde: Nils Lauvskard, Samnanger I, pp. 662-663, Jarland gnr. 36.
