1 NAME Brita Johannesdatter /Eikefet/
2 GIVN Brita Johannesdatter
2 SURN Eikefet
2 _MARNM Simenes
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1807
2 ADDR
3 CITY Eikefet
