1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/172416014/marie-eide
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Lars Eide BIRTH	1870 Norway DEATH	5 Oct 1943 (aged 72–73) Seattle, King County, Washington, USA BURIAL	 Evergreen-Washelli Memorial Park Seattle, King County, Washington, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT The Seattle Daily Times, October 7, 1943, page 31: Mrs. Berge J. Eide Funeral services for Mrs. Marie Eide, who died in a hospital Tuesday, will be held under the auspices of the Lorraine Chapter, Order of Eastern Star, at 3 o’clo
2 CONC ck Saturday at the Home Undertaking Company. Burial will be in Washelli. Mrs. Eide was born in Norway and came to this country in 1899. She lived in North Dakota before coming to Seattle in 1923. She resided at 4103 35th Ave S. W.
2 CONC  She was the widow of Berge J. Eide, a former insurance broker. Mrs. Eide held an honorary life membership in the Auxiliary of Seattle Post No. 1, American Legion. She was also a Gold Star Mother and a member of Wanconda Chapter, 
2 CONC O. E. S., Gig Harbor. Surviving are four sons, Lief B., Alf and B. Merle Eide, of Seattle, and John B. Eide, of Gig Harbor; two sisters, Mrs. Hjordis Remme, in California, and Mrs. William Winjum, Seattle; and three grandchildren.
2 CONT
