1 NAME Ole A. /Burkeland/
2 GIVN Ole A.
2 _MARNM Burkeland
2 NICK Ole Burkland
2 NICK Ola Nordmann
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 9 DEC 1871
2 PLAC Burkeland
2 ADDR
3 STAE Hordaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE 27 MAR 1963
2 PLAC Haukeland sykehus
2 ADDR
