1 CONT
1 CONT Died at age 85 in Parkview Health Center, Aneta.
1 CONT
1 CONT Services: Visitation will be Wednesday from 3 to 6 in Quam-Plaisted-Cushman Funeral Home, Cooperstown, N.D., and Thursday from 10 to 11, followed by the funeral at 11, in Union Lutheran Church, Hannaford, N.D. Burial: Union Cemete
